  <item>
    <title>小课间01 你也看过这个？谁的童年都一样！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649c2ce1f5604aa55e174012</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649c2ce1f5604aa55e174012</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jun 2023 12:51:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听我们的新栏目《小课间》！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小课间》是由《大课间》衍生出来的更加“短小精悍”的新栏目，以更加轻松、灵活的方式聊聊同学们在学校里经常讨论的日常小话题，主打一个贴近校园生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小课间》的第一个聊天话题是大家小时候看过的的动画片。你是否还记得当年陪伴着我们的那个“快乐星球”、是否有时会回忆青青草原上发生的“狼和羊的故事”、是否也曾幻想自己某一天能够变身成为“奥特曼”？如果上述描述有稍稍触动到你，欢迎收听本期节目，和我们一起回忆那些美好的童年回忆！如果你对节目任何内容有共鸣的地方，或者有希望在后面的节目中想要听到的话题，欢迎在评论区回复，来和我们一起打造课间的“快乐星球”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>仔嘟 | Bryce | 桃子 | 小丫 | AI | 夏夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">0:50</a> “别看我小，别看我小”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">2:12</a> “阿莫西林，快快显灵”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">7:36</a> 你能分清蓝猫和虹猫么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">8:50</a> 电视点播动画&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 被大家忘记的《喜羊羊与灰太狼》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 现在有在看的动画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 看过的最老的动画</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小课间》是《大课间》的子栏目，由浙江大学放课喜剧社团内部创建，以更加轻松的方式聊聊大家感兴趣的小话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【使用音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gossec: Gavotte In D Major（浙大课间铃声）</span></p><span></span><p><span>金海心 - 别看我小</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目中提到的动画片】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小鲤鱼历险记</span></p><span></span><p><span>哪吒传奇</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑猫警长</span></p><span></span><p><span>葫芦娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>天线宝宝</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫和老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>海绵宝宝</span></p><span></span><p><span>哆啦A梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>蜡笔小新</span></p><span></span><p><span>精灵宝可梦/神奇宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span>名侦探柯南</span></p><span></span><p><span>神兵小将</span></p><span></span><p><span>虹猫蓝兔七侠传</span></p><span></span><p><span>蓝猫淘气三千问</span></p><span></span><p><span>快乐星球</span></p><span></span><p><span>天眼</span></p><span></span><p><span>神雕侠侣动画版</span></p><span></span><p><span>三国演义动画版</span></p><span></span><p><span>西游记动画版</span></p><span></span><p><span>家有儿女动画版</span></p><span></span><p><span>武林外传动画版</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜羊羊与灰太狼</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶龙</span></p><span></span><p><span>果宝特攻</span></p><span></span><p><span>围棋少年</span></p><span></span><p><span>神奇小福贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>中华小当家</span></p><span></span><p><span>未闻花名</span></p><span></span><p><span>火影忍者</span></p><span></span><p><span>进击的巨人</span></p><span></span><p><span>海贼王</span></p><span></span><p><span>东京喰种</span></p><span></span><p><span>罗小黑战记</span></p><span></span><p><span>刺客伍六七</span></p><span></span><p><span>咸鱼哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>马男波杰克</span></p><span></span><p><span>辛普森一家人</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rick and Morty</span></p><span></span><p><span>请吃红小豆吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>十万个冷笑话</span></p><span></span><p><span>小蝌蚪找妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span>大闹天宫</span></p><span></span><p><span>天书奇谭</span></p>]]></description>
