  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 校外漫游记 | 怎么用声音逛西湖和看展</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6458eef17d934b8505f073f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6458eef17d934b8505f073f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 May 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春夏之交，草木际天，好天气和适时的假日似乎点燃了大家出行游玩的热情。出发前多少得做点攻略，听期目的地相关的播客无疑是个好选择。像关于杭州的播客，就有不少兼具内容和趣味的节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我邀请到了两位都在杭州的主播朋友：一位是《白衣刷展》的白衣客老师、一位是《生活碎片博物馆》的小h同学，我们一起聊了聊在杭州做播客过程中的二三事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对citywalk和声音漫游感兴趣，或者想要在下次博物馆看展时能成为朋友的义务讲解，欢迎收听我们这一期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>白衣客</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小h</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 关于「杭州播客」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a> 聊这个话题的起因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> &nbsp;从志愿者开始的播客之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 如何成为博物馆的志愿讲解员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 「第一期」的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 看展入门方法论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 主播最期待的正向反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 在线预约一个下期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">50:54</a> 口音也是「在地性」的一部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3434">57:14</a> &nbsp;有想法就去做吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大课间》是浙江大学放课喜剧社团内部创建的一档播客节目，旨在为同学们在琐碎日常中带去些许陪伴与快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【使用音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>JINBAO-曲院风荷</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海彩虹室内合唱团-南屏晚钟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【补充】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/616537b88fc22cf8c1fe4f80" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/616537b88fc22cf8c1fe4f80"><span>白衣刷展</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ffefed279dd6416e00f9595" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ffefed279dd6416e00f9595"><span>生活碎片博物馆</span></a></p>]]></description>
