  <item>
    <title>Vol.4 圣地巡礼记 | 所有浪漫的人都会相遇在路上 | 清明SP</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6427ac08994fd175bd662e49</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6427ac08994fd175bd662e49</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Apr 2023 03:59:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「异世通梦，恨不同生」</span></p><span></span><p><span>清明将近，适逢祭扫时节，想起去年看过一篇采访，其中提及现在会有不少人特意去为历史人物扫墓，不免好奇他们的情怀与想法。正好上期嘉宾闲闲就是那篇文中的采访对象之一，于是我再次邀请她以及她的好友阿陶，想让她俩跟我们一起分享一下相关的回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对历史圣地巡礼或者三国文化感兴趣，欢迎收听我们的这一期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参与人员】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp7bMaDXQoYH5tg_-N9bfWX0qBxb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FksTNDeVriCdyDzsRT_Vbvp6Q4hm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvkI9w2yhAcYEyuRmSL7arA9z3Ds.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 什么叫「圣地巡礼」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 闲闲和阿陶的第一次圣地巡礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 三国迷入坑路径一赏：《三国演义》动画和三国物语系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 时代的眼泪之《品三国》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="873">14:33</a> 见贤思齐式的官方提问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a> 阿陶心中的曹老板高光时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a> 为什么会去给历史人物扫墓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 恐怖版「博物馆奇妙夜」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 李白墓前的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> &nbsp;首阳山下虚空拜子桓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> 同好相遇在路上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">39:41</a> 闲闲的北伐之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> 巡礼出发前的一些小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">56:55</a> 宅男前辈的彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大课间》是浙江大学放课喜剧社团内部创建的一档播客节目，旨在为同学们在琐碎日常中带去些许陪伴与快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【使用音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>汤子星-梦在燃烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾黎-四季</span></p><span></span><p><span>银临-不老梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>吴炜-川流不息</span></p><span></span><p><span>【补充】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://m.thepaper.cn/rss_newsDetail_17465632?from=" data-url="https://m.thepaper.cn/rss_newsDetail_17465632?from="><span>二十四节气｜清明节，这些“天南地北浪漫人”为古人祭扫</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NK411M77H/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8f7ff8cb205a6a9fe4d256410ec18155" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NK411M77H/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8f7ff8cb205a6a9fe4d256410ec18155"><span>4k 三国演义动画版 2009 52集全</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16s411Z7go/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8f7ff8cb205a%206a9fe4d256410ec18155" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16s411Z7go/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8f7ff8cb205a%206a9fe4d256410ec18155"><span>【三国物语】『序章』乱世长歌【燃】三国无双</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ss33626?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ss33626?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>三国演义-电视剧-全集 第22集 官渡之战（下）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://tv.cctv.com/2012/03/10/VIDE1394696179856182.shtml?spm=C95797228340.P3XSH3djsU2B.0.0" data-url="https://tv.cctv.com/2012/03/10/VIDE1394696179856182.shtml?spm=C95797228340.P3XSH3djsU2B.0.0"><span>《百家讲坛——易中天品三国》 魏武挥鞭 第2集 真假曹操</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzUzOTExMTU2NA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=1337023725170032641&amp;scene=173&amp;from_msgid=2247484787&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;count=3&amp;nolastread=1#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzUzOTExMTU2NA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=1337023725170032641&amp;scene=173&amp;from_msgid=2247484787&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;count=3&amp;nolastread=1#wechat_redirect"><span>闲闲的圣地巡礼合辑</span></a></p>]]></description>
