  <item>
    <title>Vol.3 校外踏青记 | 怎么在杭州寻觅春天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641dca15179eec5331428923</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641dca15179eec5331428923</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Mar 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>3月来了，春天的脚步也来了，无论是漫步校园还是走向户外，春日印迹已经是愈发明显！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在节目之前，我们还开展了一场以春日印迹为主题的声音征集活动，收到了不少同学的热心投稿。同时我还邀请了两位喜欢户外活动的好朋友，和我一起聊了聊在杭州过春天的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望听到这期的你，无论是在户外还是在室内都能开心地拥抱春天！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>闲闲</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>ZZ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【投稿嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>咸鱼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Aquamarine</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>扣子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>夜鹤</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>ZZ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> &nbsp;对今年杭州春天的直观感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> &nbsp;「烂诗人」是个什么组织？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> &nbsp;春天就是要立年度flag</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> &nbsp;在场几位都需要播音课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> &nbsp;杭州春天吃什么？「吃饺子」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> &nbsp;莼菜可以开启的「圣地巡礼」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a> &nbsp;本期最浪漫时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a> &nbsp;播放征集活动的投稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">43:50</a> &nbsp;花絮：由ZZ发起的一次「投票」</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大课间》是浙江大学放课喜剧社团内部创建的一档播客节目，旨在为同学们在琐碎日常中带去些许陪伴与快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【使用音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>林二汶-仙乐飘飘处处闻</span></p><span></span><p><span>A公馆-拥抱春天</span></p><span></span><p><span>青年小伙子-宇宙爆炸前我们永远快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>李健-水流众生</span></p><span></span><p><span>伍佰-再度重相逢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【补充】</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位嘉宾提供的一些春日印迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpAhNUwwmZRtjRt-uYUrsvC4hQb9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvUmrM0SyzQrvqWvEKh1AaGnHsTZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgIr4k1lXFbd8UB-M1qBkD9oOTq9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrvHfFCcGzKPAXjVdDrRgy6hRhH.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
