  <item>
    <title>Vol.1 校内登台记 | 如何在浙玩转相声、即兴和单口喜剧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63d41a74531dadd2b1af783e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63d41a74531dadd2b1af783e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jan 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近年来以单口喜剧、即兴喜剧为代表的新兴喜剧形式逐渐走红出圈，它们和传统的相声一起为同学们的生活带去了许多欢乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不少同学都在线上或线下看过相关节目，但对这些不同类型的表演形式你是否有过困惑、对如何登上演出舞台又是否有过好奇与冲动。如果你对以上任何一个话题感兴趣，欢迎收听我们的这一期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可依</span></strong><span> 浙大紫艺相声社成员</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>刺猬</span></strong><span> 杭州秋裤即兴成员</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Eric</span></strong><span> 浙大放课喜剧成员</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 「即兴喜剧和这个女孩子就都爱上了」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 上台「第一次就是为了开始」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> 「漫才算是日本相声吗」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 「观众的情绪远远比你的文本和那些梗更重要」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 脱口秀有「广阔的生活的感觉」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> 即兴「更像一场体育演出」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2943">49:03</a> 可依与刺猬关于喜剧「形式限制」的精彩问答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3338">55:38</a> 管窥海外华人开放麦演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3809">1:03:29</a> 闹即兴戏剧节参赛感受分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4265">1:11:05</a> 欢迎关注浙大紫艺相声社</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大课间》是浙江大学放课喜剧社团内部创建的一档播客节目，旨在为同学们在琐碎日常中带去些许陪伴与快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【使用音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Patrice Rushen-Forget Me Nots</span></p><span></span><p><span>张行-告诉我</span></p><span></span><p><span>【补充】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1724y1y7R8/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8f7ff8cb205a6a9fe4d256410ec18155" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1724y1y7R8/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8f7ff8cb205a6a9fe4d256410ec18155"><span>20221119-20221120浙江大学紫艺相声社老友记紫金港玉泉专场选集</span></a></p>]]></description>
